Subject: [PATCH] drm/panel: delay SOFEF03F illumination until pixel TX completes

The stock panel needs a complete frame in GRAM before illumination. Keep
it blank through prepare/enable and defer positive backlight updates.
Have DPU commit completion wait for TX done only for opted-in panels,
then enable their backlight and followers. Reset readiness on disable
and retain normal behavior for other panels. CTL start or flip events
are insufficient.

